=4 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Quelveuiat}. (I-10, Middle Floor)
* Zone into {z:Lufaise Meadows} by taking the south exit at (I-6).
* Head to (H-10) afterwards.
** Clear any nearby {m:Orcs|Orc} as they will link.
* Click the **???** at the top of the platform to spawn {m:Splinterspine Grukjuk}, a {p:Ranger} {m:Orc} NM.
** Defeat {m:Splinterspine Grukjuk}.
* Return to {z:Tavnazian Safehold} and speak with {n:Quelveuiat} to complete the quest.

=4 Optional
* After completing the quest you may trade {n:Quelveuiat} a {@i:Sealion Crest Key|1658} {i:Sealion Crest Key|Sealion Crest Key|1658} and a {@i:Coral Crest Key|1659} {i:Coral Crest Key|Coral Crest Key|1659} to obtain a {@k} {k:Temple Knight key}.
** This allows you to open the large door to the inner part of {z:Sacrarium} at (H-7) solo.

